{"4442750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Void Hunters", "steam_appid": 4442750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the wilds, where maps lead nowhere and law means nothing, the Void Hunters make their stand. Living on the outskirts of society, they hunt the world-devouring Void. In this dark fantasy, F2P, turn-based hero collector, all Hunters are fully realized characters with a place in this world, relationships to uncover, and distinct motivations that shape who they become.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR SQUAD OF HUNTERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a diverse cast of Void Hunters and grow them your way. Level them up, upgrade skills, refine gear, and prepare a team that can handle what comes next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENGAGE IN TACTICAL BATTLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outthink brutal enemies with smart ability timing and careful decision-making in a combat system that rewards direct engagement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4442750/extras/dfe2b631c8beb5867293ca74898f0cff.poster.avif?t=1784031209\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4442750/extras/dfe2b631c8beb5867293ca74898f0cff.webm?t=1784031209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4442750/extras/dfe2b631c8beb5867293ca74898f0cff.mp4?t=1784031209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PUSH YOUR LIMITS IN OBJECTIVE CHALLENGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face uniquely challenging opponents and complete special battle objectives that push your tactics and your squad-building to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER ROGUELITE-BASED MISSIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your Hunters in evolving missions where each attempt brings fresh choices and bonuses that reshape your squad’s power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4442750/extras/7c8b7ac4c371294a0807aa73d033b222.poster.avif?t=1784031209\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4442750/extras/7c8b7ac4c371294a0807aa73d033b222.webm?t=1784031209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4442750/extras/7c8b7ac4c371294a0807aa73d033b222.mp4?t=1784031209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLIMB THE RIVALRY RANKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for top scores and promotions to higher tiers battling against other squads in time-limited challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER THE VOID’S TRUTH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate rising Void activity, track missing Hunters and survive escalating threats in the story campaign as tensions with the dogmatic religious Order rise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4442750/extras/ecd2d12fe3bb8627d5f7b7853d046295.poster.avif?t=1784031209\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4442750/extras/ecd2d12fe3bb8627d5f7b7853d046295.webm?t=1784031209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4442750/extras/ecd2d12fe3bb8627d5f7b7853d046295.mp4?t=1784031209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the wilds, where maps lead nowhere and law means nothing, the Void Hunters make their stand. Living on the outskirts of society, they hunt the world-devouring Void. In this dark fantasy, F2P, turn-based hero collector, all Hunters are fully realized characters with a place in this world, relationships to uncover, and distinct motivations that shape who they become.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR SQUAD OF HUNTERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a diverse cast of Void Hunters and grow them your way. Level them up, upgrade skills, refine gear, and prepare a team that can handle what comes next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENGAGE IN TACTICAL BATTLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outthink brutal enemies with smart ability timing and careful decision-making in a combat system that rewards direct engagement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4442750/extras/dfe2b631c8beb5867293ca74898f0cff.poster.avif?t=1784031209\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4442750/extras/dfe2b631c8beb5867293ca74898f0cff.webm?t=1784031209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4442750/extras/dfe2b631c8beb5867293ca74898f0cff.mp4?t=1784031209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PUSH YOUR LIMITS IN OBJECTIVE CHALLENGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face uniquely challenging opponents and complete special battle objectives that push your tactics and your squad-building to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER ROGUELITE-BASED MISSIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your Hunters in evolving missions where each attempt brings fresh choices and bonuses that reshape your squad’s power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4442750/extras/7c8b7ac4c371294a0807aa73d033b222.poster.avif?t=1784031209\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4442750/extras/7c8b7ac4c371294a0807aa73d033b222.webm?t=1784031209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4442750/extras/7c8b7ac4c371294a0807aa73d033b222.mp4?t=1784031209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLIMB THE RIVALRY RANKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for top scores and promotions to higher tiers battling against other squads in time-limited challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER THE VOID’S TRUTH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate rising Void activity, track missing Hunters and survive escalating threats in the story campaign as tensions with the dogmatic religious Order rise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4442750/extras/ecd2d12fe3bb8627d5f7b7853d046295.poster.avif?t=1784031209\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst